.TH ZCONFIGURE-GUI 1 "May 2026" "zconfigure-gui 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zconfigure-gui \- graphical configure/build tool for autotools projects
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zconfigure-gui
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ project-path ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ZConfigure GUI provides a graphical interface for configuring,
building and installing autotools-based projects (using configure/make).
.PP
It features:
.IP \(bu 2
Project option browsing with categorized configure options
.IP \(bu 2
Visual selection and configuration of build options
.IP \(bu 2
Real-time command generation preview
.IP \(bu 2
Build output monitoring with colored status messages
.IP \(bu 2
Recent project history management
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Show help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-v, \-\-version\fR
Show version information and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fItitle\fR
Set custom window title.
.TP
\fIproject-path\fR
Path to the project directory to open (optional).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/zconfigure-gui/zconfigure-config.json
User configuration file containing recent projects and window settings.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANG, LC_ALL
Specify the language for translations. Supported: zh_CN, en_US.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Launch the application:
.RS
.EX
zconfigure-gui
.EE
.RE
.PP
Open a specific project:
.RS
.EX
zconfigure-gui /path/to/project
.EE
.RE
.PP
Set custom window title:
.RS
.EX
zconfigure-gui --title "My Project Build"
.EE
.RE
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://gitee.com/sunstom/media-analyzer/issues
